    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You spent much of your youth trailing traveling fairs and carnivals, doing odd jobs for musicians and acrobats in exchange for lessons. You might have learned to walk a tightrope, to play the lute in a style all your own, or to recite poetry with flawless diction. Even now, applause is what you live for, and the stage still calls to you.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Dexterity, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.nQPQRlZ6fWml4Fw9]{Musician}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Acrobatics and Performance</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> <em>Choose one kind of</em> Musical Instrument</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) Musical Instrument (same as above), 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagCostume0000]{Costumes}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagMirror00000]{Mirror}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPerfume0000]{Perfume}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesTrav]{Traveler's Clothes}, 11 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
